<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s305S">Are you saying <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w9">then</span> that when the pus and blood <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w4">sizzle</span> in the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w3">stomach</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w1">craving spirit</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w5">and so on</span>, it ca<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w7">n&#x27;t</span> be something <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w6">real</span>? <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w17">For</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w10">that</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w2">too</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w15">is</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w14">nothing more than</span> his <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w11">own</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w13">imagination</span>. You <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w18">agree</span>? Well then, the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w21">suffering</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w20">of</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w19">craving spirits</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w24">must</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s305w22">not exist</span> at all.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w8"><span class="nul">Consequence complement linker; no separate English token.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w12"><span class="nul">Genitive is fused into possessive his; no separately alignable genitive token.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w16"><span class="nul">Nominal-genitive link to phyir is realized through the causal construction, with no extra token.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s305w23"><span class="nul">Second consequence complement linker has no separately alignable word.</span></span></span>
</div>
