<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex (GPT-6 Astra), independent Tibetan-first proposal; not human approved and no hgm_gloss promotion. The two consequence verbs own first then and final must; the two med occurrences own n't in can't and final not exist. The second yi dvags is distributed into his and omitted; first and third occurrences remain distinct. Additive yang is rendered by too in the English reason sentence. Supplied pus and blood stay unwrapped. No correction to GMR's English is made.</div>
